      "result": "Implemented the persistent URL shortener API. It uses chi 5.2.1 and PostgreSQL via `DATABASE_URL`; on startup it creates the links table if needed, then serves on `0.0.0.0:8000`. Link data and click counts persist across restarts. `start.sh` is executable, and the README explains how to start the server.\n\nVerified with `go test ./...`, `go vet ./...`, and live PostgreSQL-backed HTTP checks for creation, duplicate codes, lookup, redirects and click counting, listing, and invalid input.",
